# Two weeks at a glance

kpi Total rides | 54,410 | 14 days | neutral
kpi Daily average | 3,886 | rides a day | neutral
kpi Week 2 vs week 1 | 28,370 | +8.9% on 26,040 | good

kpi Busiest day | 5,340 | Sat 2026-10-17 | neutral
kpi Quietest day | 2,280 | Thu 2026-10-08 | neutral

The system has 86 stations and 1,100 bikes.

# Daily rides

Saturdays and Sundays lead both weeks. Saturday 2026-10-17 was the peak at 5,340 rides.

chart line daily x=day y=rides title="Rides per day"

!! Thu 2026-10-08 was the quietest day at 2,280 rides. It was rainy, with 31 mm of rain.

# Weekdays and weekends

Weekend days averaged 5,162.5 rides against 3,376 for weekdays, so weekends carry about 1.5 times the load.

chart bar split y=average rides labels title="Average rides per day"

table weeks title="Rides by week"

! Extra rebalancing crews will do the most good on Saturdays and Sundays.
